        ifTheySay: [{ heard: "Did he choose it?", reply: "The ancient sources say yes — he was old and decided his life was complete. The Stoics saw this as a rational choice when nature no longer allows virtuous living. But that's his decision, not a teaching. The teaching is about how to live, not how to die." }],
